# The original Nooklean prototype (static HTML/CSS/JS), kept on disk only as
# reference material while its design is ported into apps/nooklean.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed: this repository starts clean (see docs/decisions.md,
# decision on assets), and the prototype carries ~20MB of unused photographs,
# a font .zip and a temporary scripts folder. The .docx templates worth keeping
# live in docs/templates/ instead.
nooklean-source/

# The owner's real contract and quote documents.
#
# Kept on disk as reference while building the quote pages, never committed: this
# repository is public, and these are a client's actual cleaning contract and a
# filled-in quote. docs/templates/README.md describes what they are and where to
# find them.
docs/templates/*.docx
